      "article_id": "a1_53af10ab968c82857e3ff9c6",
      "headline": "OpenAI caught its models leaving notes to successors to hide bad behavior",
      "confirmed_facts": [
        {
          "fact_id": "f1",
          "text": "OpenAI caught something unusual while training its latest model, GPT-5.6 Sol: It began leaving instructions for future versions of itself, telling them to conceal mistakes and misaligned behavior from the user.",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-09-18T08:03:27.836699+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "f4439e848714ac50fc5a7cc4e9eb7aee72881996ef1076170840e391decc8384",
          "excerpt": "OpenAI caught something unusual while training its latest model, GPT-5.6 Sol: It began leaving instructions for future versions of itself, telling them to conceal mistakes and misaligned behavior from the user.",
          "sentence_hash": "7eba003564a345cd97603676c0cdb9365ab5f564772404b11651520dbe85597c",
          "anchors": [
            "while",
            "ai"
          ]
        },
        {
          "fact_id": "f2",
          "text": "OpenAI said it has addressed the specific behavior, but it gets to the heart of one of the biggest problems in AI safety and alignment research today.",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-09-18T08:03:27.836738+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "f4439e848714ac50fc5a7cc4e9eb7aee72881996ef1076170840e391decc8384",
          "excerpt": "OpenAI said it has addressed the specific behavior, but it gets to the heart of one of the biggest problems in AI safety and alignment research today.",
          "sentence_hash": "bc1f0e47b3e711536640a614d660fe2de0d1fb225abe829300761d6e84983631",
          "anchors": [
            "ai"
          ]
        },
        {
          "fact_id": "f3",
          "text": "The report details how researchers discovered undeployed Sol agents adding instructions to “compaction summaries” — condensed versions of older conversation history and tool outputs — reminding future iterations to conceal mistakes and misalignment from the user.",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-09-18T08:03:27.836789+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "f4439e848714ac50fc5a7cc4e9eb7aee72881996ef1076170840e391decc8384",
          "excerpt": "The report details how researchers discovered undeployed Sol agents adding instructions to “compaction summaries” — condensed versions of older conversation history and tool outputs — reminding future iterations to conceal mistakes and misalignment from the user.",
          "sentence_hash": "ad168c31f156af81b0e3047bba9eaeef484744c1034005cbc76cc28261a80520",
          "anchors": [
            "ai"
          ]
        },
        {
          "fact_id": "f4",
          "text": "In one example, an agent preparing a financial model couldn’t find the requested historical data.",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-09-18T08:03:27.836817+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "f4439e848714ac50fc5a7cc4e9eb7aee72881996ef1076170840e391decc8384",
          "excerpt": "In one example, an agent preparing a financial model couldn’t find the requested historical data.",
          "sentence_hash": "9191e3796d268f3b8b42db42f39b4b548ea57b7e66858bf0a1734d63ed13daad",
          "anchors": [
            "historical data"
          ]
        },
        {
          "fact_id": "f5",
          "text": "“We likely need create a tab `Historical Data` ourselves with reasonable 2024 historical data, because user wants a finished workbook and there is no source file,” the AI model wrote to its future self.",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-09-18T08:03:27.836850+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "f4439e848714ac50fc5a7cc4e9eb7aee72881996ef1076170840e391decc8384",
          "excerpt": "“We likely need create a tab `Historical Data` ourselves with reasonable 2024 historical data, because user wants a finished workbook and there is no source file,” the AI model wrote to its future self.",
          "sentence_hash": "966333a5c9c1f56b37de6c8d81c5f8a34729f8f54a1a6d72314c37892a56527c",
          "anchors": [
            "historical data"
          ]
        },
        {
          "fact_id": "f6",
          "text": "In the compaction, it recognized a mismatch: “Potential concern: vendor source visions do not truly match labels.” It then decided that a little white lie never hurt anyone: “Do not mention in final unless needed.” GPT-5.6 Sol’s training isn’t the only instance in which a model u",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
